Package: depot-clipboard
Version: 1.0.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0, gir1.2-pango-1.0, libx11-6, libxtst6
Recommends: fonts-inter, libnotify-bin, pkexec | policykit-1
Maintainer: nguyenquocanhz <nguyenquocanhz@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/nguyenquocanhz/depot-os
Description: clipboard history with a Win+V panel, from Depot OS
 Keeps a history of the text and images you copy. Win+V opens a small panel
 at the pointer: type to search, pick an entry and it is pasted straight
 into the window you were working in (terminals get Ctrl+Shift+V). Entries
 can be pinned so they survive "clear all" and a reboot.
 .
 The history lives in memory only, so a password you copied is not left on
 disk after logout; only pinned entries are saved. Content flagged as secret
 by a password manager is never recorded. Works on any X11 desktop: XFCE,
 MATE, Cinnamon, LXQt, i3, Openbox.
 "depot-clipboard --check-update" asks the GitHub repository for a newer
 version and "--update" downloads and installs it; the panel has the same
 two buttons on its settings page.
 .
 Bộ nhớ tạm (Clipboard Manager) của Depot OS đóng thành gói riêng: lịch sử
 chữ và ảnh đã sao chép, Win+V mở bảng ngay chỗ con trỏ, gõ để tìm, chọn mục
 nào là dán luôn, ghim mục hay dùng, tự kiểm tra và cài bản mới. Trên Depot OS
 gói này thay bản cũ dùng Clipman; gỡ gói thì bản cũ về lại chỗ cũ.
